          "role": "urn:stdo-3:claude:i3:vocabulary:role:support",
          "ref": "urn:stdo-3:claude:i3:clause:p2"
        }
      ],
      "statement": "A constraint surface states, for a declared subject and work boundary, the obligations and the permitted freedom of the work: its objects and their meanings, the predicates and dependencies that bear on it, the admissible operations, the required results, the authority, the evidence and the conditions still unresolved.",
      "source_refs": [
        "stdo-3://build_tenants/claude/standards/AXIOMATIC_CALCULUS.md#constraint-surfaces"
